Privacy Policy for Calorie Cam

Last updated: August 1, 2026

This Privacy Policy describes Our policies and procedures regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of Your information when You use the Service and explains Your privacy rights.

Calorie Cam is designed so that the most sensitive input — photos of your food — is never stored. By using the Service, You agree to this Privacy Policy.

Summary

- Meal photos are analyzed and then immediately deleted. They are never stored on Our servers or in Our database.
- AI analysis requests are processed with Zero Data Retention routing.
- Every nutrition result is an estimate shown as a range that You can review and correct. Results are not medical advice.
- We do not use advertising, analytics trackers, or data brokers, and We never sell Your data.
- You can delete Your account and all associated data from inside the app at any time.

